= On the Campaign Trail

Three weeks, a battlebus, and a press pack that wants a picture every day.

- @photo: Photo opportunities.
- @marginals: A whistle-stop tour of the marginals.
- @scotland: Fly north to Scotland.
- @easy_discard

@photo
on-arrival: thatcher_rating += 3

You hold a newborn calf on a Suffolk farm for the photographers, for rather longer than Denis thinks wise. It makes every front page.

